          "type": "text",
          "html": "<p class=\"display\">Farewell and Resurrection</p>"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "<p class=\"align-center\">\"Farewell and Resurrection\" is a performance of mine during which period I felt pushed to the point of destruction for resurrection.<br/><br/>Through this act, all the archives of my previous collected negatives and the single copy of my most treasured piece are burned into ashes. I chose my birthplace where the river meets the ocean to make this performative act. Footages are recorded during the whole process and showcased in this feed.<br/><br/>It is negation of negation, namely quintessential gesture to begin anew.<br/><br/>前者に拠って、自己批判の对象となった中平の初期作品を、あえて展示することの是非に関する問いが生起するであらう。これに対し、私たちわ、過去の否定という重い意味を伝えるために、是非とも当の初期作品を充分に示す必要があると考えた。<br/><br/>原点復帰－横浜 中平卓马<br/><br/>Based on the former, questions arise about the pros and cons of exhibiting Nakahira's early works, which became the object of self-criticism. On the other hand, in order to convey the heavy meaning of denial of the past, we thought that it was necessary to fully show the initial work in question.<br/><br/>DEGREE ZERO - YOKOHAMA NAKAHIRA TAKUMA</p>"
        }
      ]
